      "rid": "doc_1.src_content.1",
      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Dear Mrs. Doyle: God bless you . . I am sending this (above) just as I found it this morning. With several others I got From- ane poison in Milwaukee and had an experience quite worthwhile. Thanks be to God. Afterwards too, here and in St. Joseph Hospital in Ft. Wayne. Doctor Hoffman there, I hear, feared I would lose my lower legs. I never thought of such a serious thing. Thank God they are again quite OK.",
      "per_polygon": "Dear Mrs. Doyle: God bless you . . . I am sending this (above) just as I found it this morning. With several others I got From- ane poison in Milwaukee and had an experience quite worthwhile. Thanks be to God. Afterwards too, here and in St. Joseph Hospital in Ft. Wayne. Doctor Hoffman there, I hear, feared I would lose my lower legs. I never thought of such a serious thing. Thank God they are again quite OK.",
